# Live state of a running lab: baseline, journal, heartbeat, log.
#
# The prefix is whatever `--out` was given, and these were listed by the one
# prefix in use at the time — so a run called `fixes` walked straight past them
# into three commits. The generated shapes are matched by suffix now.
weights/*.heartbeat.json
weights/*.journal.json
weights/*.log
weights/*.log.*
weights/lab/
# The baseline is the exception: `<out>.json` is the same shape as a weights
# file written by hand, and those are tracked on purpose. It has to be named.
weights/lab.json
weights/lab.start.json
weights/fixes.json
